[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6255.669, "timestamp": "01:44:15", "text": "不，等等。 呃，说实话，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6258.95, "timestamp": "01:44:18", "text": "感觉今天是我了解 LGBTQ 是什么的第一天"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6261.59, "timestamp": "01:44:21", "text": "。 我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6265.189, "timestamp": "01:44:25", "text": "2019年的时候也这样直播过。有个陌生人走进我的聊天室，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6268.39, "timestamp": "01:44:28", "text": "问我：“你是同性恋吗"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6270.47, "timestamp": "01:44:30", "text": "？你是LGBT群体的一员吗"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6273.03, "timestamp": "01:44:33", "text": "？” 我当时就想，“啊？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6277.43, "timestamp": "01:44:37", "text": "LGBTQ+是什么意思？” 还有一些其他的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6280.39, "timestamp": "01:44:40", "text": "我上网搜了一下。 我就是这样了解到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6283.75, "timestamp": "01:44:43", "text": "人们有不同的性别之类的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6288.47, "timestamp": "01:44:48", "text": "。 我的天哪，我真是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6291.75, "timestamp": "01:44:51", "text": "又惊又喜"}]